    "text": "Students must complete an additional 4 courses from any research area they wish. A maximum of 2 courses from related fields may be applied as substitutes to the upper-division elective requirements if they are approved by the Undergraduate Major Advisor.\nComplete at least 4 of:\n- Any course from an Upper Division Research Area\n- AFRICAM 131\n- AFRICAM 134\n- AFRICAM 256B\n- AFRICAM 28AC\n- AFRICAM C156\n- AFRICAM C156\n- AFRICAM N131\n- AMERSTD 102\n- AMERSTD 102AC\n- AMERSTD C111A\n- AMERSTD C112A\n- AMERSTD C112B\n- AMERSTD C112F\n- AMERSTD C171\n- ANTHRO 121A\n- ANTHRO 126M\n- ANTHRO 129D\n- ANTHRO 135B … (see the catalog for the rest)",
